{"t":"PHM","n":"PulteGroup, Inc.","nKo":"풀테그룹","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":126.39,"chg":1.72,"chgPct":0.0138,"prev":124.67,"dayH":126.53,"dayL":123.45,"w52H":144.5,"w52L":107.16,"vol":1427949,"avgVol":1756330,"mcap":23266723840,"pe":13.5,"fpe":13.43,"eps":9.36,"feps":9.41,"pb":1.78,"div":1.08,"divY":0.0085,"beta":1.18,"short":7956770,"shortPct":0.0582,"shortRatio":3.67,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Cyclical","sKo":"소비자 경기순환","i":"Residential Construction","iKo":"주거용 건축","city":"Atlanta","emp":6506,"web":"https://pultegroupinc.com","sum":"PulteGroup, Inc., through its subsidiaries, engages in the homebuilding business in the United States. The company is involved in the acquisition and development of land primarily for residential purposes, as well as construction of housing; and sale of single-family detached homes; and attached homes, such as townhomes, condominiums, and duplexes under the Centex, Pulte Homes, Del Webb, DiVosta Homes, and John Wieland Homes and Neighborhoods brands. It also engages in the mortgage banking, title, and insurance agency operations. PulteGroup, Inc. was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","sumKo":"PulteGroup, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 주택 건설 사업에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 주로 주거용 토지 취득 및 개발과 주택 건설에 참여하고 있습니다. 단독 단독 주택 판매; Centex, Pulte Homes, Del Webb, DiVosta Homes, John Wieland Homes and Neighborhoods 브랜드의 타운홈, 콘도미니엄, 듀플렉스 등의 부속 주택도 포함됩니다. 또한 모기지 뱅킹, 소유권 및 보험 대행사 운영에도 참여합니다. PulteGroup, Inc.는 1950년에 설립되었으며 조지아주 애틀랜타에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":16228995000,"ni":2617317000},{"y":2023,"rev":16061578000,"ni":2602372000},{"y":2024,"rev":17946950000,"ni":3083262000},{"y":2025,"rev":17311953000,"ni":2218730000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":4610748000,"ni":501614000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":3408572000,"ni":346996000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":3982957000,"ni":472003000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":3973846000,"ni":475727000}],"eps":[{"q":"4Q2025","act":2.56,"est":2.829},{"q":"1Q2026","act":1.79,"est":1.811},